  "body": "<h1>NFL DFS Projections: Week 12 (DraftKings)</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\">DraftKings main slate · <strong>Sunday, November 29</strong> · 9 games · By <strong>Chris Spags</strong> · <!--@@SLATE-PUBLISHED@@--> · Numbers as of <time datetime=\"2026-11-24T22:02:54-05:00\">November 24, 10:02 PM ET</time></p>\n<p>These are this week's NFL DFS projections: every SPAGS model projection for the Week 12 DraftKings main slate, 116 players at quarterback, running back, wide receiver, tight end and defense, from the November 24, 10:02 PM ET run of the Splash Play NFL model built by Chris Spags. Joe Burrow has the highest projection at 23.9 DraftKings points for $7,700.</p>\n<p>The position leaders are Joe Burrow at quarterback (23.9, $7,700), Bijan Robinson at running back (22.4, $7,700), Ja'Marr Chase at wide receiver (23.4, $8,900), Trey McBride at tight end (16.6, $6,600) and the Jaguars at defense (7.8, $4,000).</p>\n<p>This page always shows the current week and updates each time the main-slate numbers are published, so check the time above before you build.</p>\n<!-- SLOT:OFFER-TOP -->\n<!--@@SLATE-OFFER@@-->\n<h2>Top Week 12 quarterback projections (DraftKings main slate)</h2>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Player</th><th>Salary</th><th>SPAGS proj</th><th>Pts/$1K</th><th>Game</th><th>Team total</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nfl/players/joe-burrow/\">Joe Burrow</a></td><td>$7,700</td><td class=\"num\">23.9</td><td class=\"num\">3.10</td><td>CIN vs NO</td><td>30.25</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nfl/players/trevor-lawrence/\">Trevor Lawrence</a></td><td>$6,700</td><td class=\"num\">21.6</td><td class=\"num\">3.22</td><td>JAX vs TEN</td><td>31.5</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nfl/players/cj-stroud/\">C.J. Stroud</a></td><td>$6,500</td><td class=\"num\">20.4</td><td class=\"num\">3.14</td><td>HOU vs BAL</td><td>27.25</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nfl/players/jayden-daniels/\">Jayde